# Python

Use Python 3.11+.

Use type hints for public functions and important internal structures.

Prefer small functions with a single responsibility.

Use FastAPI for HTTP APIs.

Use Pydantic models for API and agent input/output schemas.

Keep AI/LLM calls isolated behind explicit services or adapters.

Do not put LLM calls directly inside API route handlers.

External integrations should be isolated behind services.

Errors should be explicit and useful for debugging.

Write tests for important business logic.